  "title": "Enterprise AI needs connected intelligence. Find ours where you already work.",
  "summary": "The most sophisticated AI in the world doesn't matter if it's sitting outside the workflow where decisions get made. That’s why Moody's partnerships with Microsoft, Anthropic, AWS, and OpenAI are built around a single premise: decision-grade intelligence belongs where our customer’s analysts, risk teams, and commercial functions currently work every day.",
